  "steps": [
    "Cook pasta al dente; save 50ml pasta water before draining.",
    "Season chicken with salt and pepper. Fry in oil on medium-high 1 minute per side; remove.",
    "Fry onion 3 minutes. Add garlic; fry 20 seconds. Add evaporated milk mixed with cornstarch; stir until slightly thickened.",
    "Add pasta water, parmesan and oregano; stir. Add spinach; stir until wilted.",
    "Return chicken; add pasta; stir to combine."
